    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "OpenAI-compatible serverless inference API for Nscale. Provides chat completions, text completions, embeddings, image generation, and model discovery against open models (Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek, GPT OSS, Mistral, Flux) served on Nscale GPU infrastructure. Authenticate with a Bearer API key issued from the Nscale console.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Nscale Support",
